voyager-brain-rebuild (Bioqore): carry-forward baseline
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source: github.com/Bioqore/voyager-brain-rebuild (commit 45ccce8),
voyager_rebuild/core/evaluation.py (`_carry_forward_col`) and REBUILD.md §3-4.
License: proprietary to Bioqore.

Idea credit; re-implemented, no code copied. The idea: a model that predicts a
unit's value at a larger scale must beat that unit's own earlier-scale
measurement carried forward. Kalos's version is
kalos/core/baselines.py (`carry_forward_rank_agreement`): Spearman and top-k
agreement on per-unit means, a cluster-bootstrap CI, a paired comparison with
the model, and refusals below 5 shared units.
